    <div style="text-align: justify; margin-left: 56.7pt; line-height: 1.25;">During the three months ended March 31, 2024 and 2023, inventory expensed to cost of goods sold of cannabis products was $9,125 and $8,903, respectively, which included $10 and
      $339 of non-cash expense, respectively, related to the changes in fair value of inventory sold.</div>
    <div style="line-height: 1.25;"><br style="line-height: 1.25;">
    </div>
    <div style="text-align: justify; margin-left: 56.7pt; line-height: 1.25;">Cost of revenues in three months period ended March 31, 2024 and 2023, also include production overhead not allocated to costs of inventories produced and recognized as an
      expense as incurred.</div>
    <div style="line-height: 1.25;"><br style="line-height: 1.25;">
    </div>
